## Alert Flow — 20 minutes
##
## Acoustic parameters mirrored from a public curated session library;
## score re-authored in SBaGen .sbg format.
## Independent work - not affiliated with or endorsed by any third party.
##
##
## The source uses isochronic tones; entrain has no isochronic voice
## yet, so the same beat rates (10/14/18/22 Hz) are rendered as
## binaural pairs over a quiet white bed. Headphones required.
##
## Steady climb for work and study: a 250 Hz alpha warm-up, then a
## 400 Hz carrier rising 14 -> 22 Hz.

off: -
alpha-preparation: white/10
alpha-state: white/5 250+10/10
beta-state: white/5 400+14/10
peak-one: white/5 400+18/15
peak-two: white/5 400+22/15

00:00:00 off
00:00:15 alpha-preparation
00:01:00 alpha-preparation
00:05:00 alpha-state
00:10:00 beta-state
00:14:00 peak-one
00:16:00 peak-one
00:18:00 peak-two
00:19:30 peak-two
00:20:00 off
